  "order": 6.6,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The steps of a flow, each with how many reached it and what share of the step before moved on. Centered bars narrow with the count, so the biggest drop is visible at a glance; the words carry the exact numbers.",
    "id": "Tahap-tahap sebuah alur, masing-masing dengan berapa orang yang mencapainya dan berapa persen dari tahap sebelumnya yang lanjut. Batang di tengah menyempit mengikuti jumlahnya, jadi penurunan terbesar terlihat sekilas; kata-katanya membawa angka pastinya."
  },
  "titleId": "Funnel",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "From opening the page to permit issued",
        "desc": "Under 40 % moving on marks the step red in words. Bars grow from the center on first view, one after another.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"fn-q\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"fn-q\">At which step do applicants stop?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">People at each step, 1 to 16 November</div></div>\n  <ol class=\"funnel\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Business permit application flow, 1 to 16 November\">\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Opened the business permit page</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">12,480</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 42.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Started the form</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">5,240</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">42% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 24.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Uploaded documents</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">3,110</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">59% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 18.3%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Submitted the application</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">2,290</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">74% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 4.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Permit issued</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">610</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">27% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n  <div class=\"chart-card__foot\"><span>Biggest loss: application to permit issued, 27% move on</span></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A short funnel",
        "desc": "Four steps of recruiting posyandu volunteers.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\" aria-labelledby=\"fn-h\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"fn-h\">How many volunteer candidates make it through?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Posyandu volunteer registration, second round</div></div>\n  <ol class=\"funnel\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Posyandu volunteer recruitment, second round\">\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Registered</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">214</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 44.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Passed document check</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">96</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">45% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 14.5%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Interviewed</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">31</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">32% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 2.8%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Accepted</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">6</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">19% of the step before</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n</section>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Dari membuka halaman sampai izin terbit",
        "desc": "Jika kurang dari 40 % yang lanjut, tahap itu ditandai merah lewat teksnya. Batang tumbuh dari tengah saat pertama terlihat, satu per satu.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"fn-q\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"fn-q\">Di tahap mana pemohon berhenti?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Jumlah orang di setiap tahap, 1 sampai 16 November</div></div>\n  <ol class=\"funnel\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Alur permohonan izin usaha, 1 sampai 16 November\">\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Membuka halaman izin usaha</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">12.480</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 42.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Mulai mengisi formulir</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">5.240</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">42% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 24.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Mengunggah berkas</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">3.110</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">59% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 18.3%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Mengirim permohonan</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">2.290</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">74% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 4.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Izin terbit</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">610</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">27% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n  <div class=\"chart-card__foot\"><span>Kehilangan terbesar: dari permohonan ke izin terbit, 27% lanjut</span></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Funnel pendek",
        "desc": "Empat tahap rekrutmen kader posyandu.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\" aria-labelledby=\"fn-h\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"fn-h\">Berapa calon kader yang lolos sampai akhir?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Pendaftaran kader posyandu, gelombang kedua</div></div>\n  <ol class=\"funnel\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Alur rekrutmen kader posyandu, gelombang kedua\">\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Mendaftar</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">214</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row\" style=\"--v: 44.9%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Lolos seleksi berkas</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">96</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">45% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 14.5%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Diwawancarai</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">31</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">32% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"funnel__row is-drop\" style=\"--v: 2.8%;\">\n    <div class=\"funnel__meta\"><span class=\"funnel__label\">Diterima</span><span><span class=\"funnel__val\">6</span><span class=\"funnel__conv\">19% dari tahap sebelumnya</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"funnel__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"funnel__bar\"></span></div>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n</section>"
